sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Storefront Consumer
    participant Storefront as React 18 Storefront
    participant PostgREST as Supabase PostgREST / RPC
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (12 Tables)
    participant Express as Node.js / Express Bridge
    participant Stripe as Stripe Checkout API
    participant Delivery as UAE Courier (COD Rail)

    Customer->>Storefront: Click "Checkout"
    Storefront->>PostgREST: RPC calculate_cart_total(items, coupon_code)
    PostgREST->>PG: Validate unit prices, variant stock & coupon rules
    PG-->>Storefront: Deterministic total, discount, and tax

    alt Payment Method: Stripe Hosted Checkout
        Storefront->>Express: POST /api/create-checkout-session (cart_id, items, user_jwt)
        Express->>Stripe: stripe.checkout.sessions.create({ line_items, metadata })
        Stripe-->>Express: { sessionId, checkoutUrl }
        Express-->>Storefront: Redirect to Stripe Hosted Checkout
        Customer->>Stripe: Submits payment
        Stripe->>Express: Webhook event checkout.session.completed
        Express->>PostgREST: UPDATE orders SET status = 'paid', payment_ref = stripe_pi
        PostgREST->>PG: Decrement product variant stock & emit audit log
        Express-->>Stripe: 200 OK
        Stripe-->>Customer: Redirect to /order-success
    else Payment Method: UAE Cash on Delivery (COD)
        Storefront->>PostgREST: INSERT INTO orders (user_id, status='pending_cod', payment_method='cod')
        PostgREST->>PG: Reserve variant inventory & flag courier dispatch
        PG-->>Storefront: Order Confirmation (Order ID & Tracking Code)
        Storefront-->>Customer: Render COD receipt & delivery tracking
        Delivery->>Customer: Dispatch fragrance package & collect cash
    end
